      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Wakabi vombo va muziki hekalunyi",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 25:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mzuri Daudi na vilongozi va Walawi werewisaghueghe Walawi winughagha wilongozeghe wutasi: Asafu, na Hemani, na Jeduthuni wikaie wachili wa ilagho ja Mlungu, jikinughwa ni chumbo riborwagha kwa zeze, na vinubi, na banjo. Ughu nigho mtalo ghwa awo werebonyeroghe kwa iyo kazi: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.25.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.25.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 25:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "wana wa Asafu: Zakuri, Josefu, Nethania, na Sharela; wikilongozwa ni Asafu uo orekoghe ukichila kwa wulongozi ghwa mzuri. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.25.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.25.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 25:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wana wa Jeduthuni: Gedalia, Seri, Jeshaia, Shimei, Hashabia, na Matithia; wandu warandadu; wikalongozwa ni ndee Jeduthuni, uo orekoghe kwa kubora na zeze ukifunya chawucha na kumkasa BWANA. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.25.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.25.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 25:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wana wa Hemani: Bukia, Matania, Uzieli, Shebueli na Jerimothi, Hanania, Hanani, Eliatha, Gidathi, Romamtiezeri, Joshbekasha, Malothi, Hothiri, Mahaziothi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.25.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.25.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 25:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Awa wose werekoghe wana wa Hemani mchili wa mzuri; nao orelaghiriloghe ni Mlungu kukaia uchanekwa kukumika, kwa kumneka Hemani wadawana ikumi na bana na wai wadadu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.25.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.25.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 25:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wose werekoghe aisi ya wulongozi ghwa ndee kwa kubonya muziki andenyi ya Hekalu ya Mlungu. Asafu, Jeduthuni, na Hemani werekoghe aisi ya mzuri. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.25.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.25.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 25:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mtalo ghwawo chiaimweri na waruna awo werefundishiroghe kum'boria BWANA wikamanya ghose ghorekoghe wandu maghana awi na mirongo wunyanya na wunyanya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.25.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.25.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 25:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nawo werekabieghe kura aighu ya kazi rawo, ukaiagha m'baa angu mtini; ufundishikie na wawuyazoya kufundishwa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.25.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.25.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
